From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: leozhang <zwj8727@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:31:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] k27 tree, piano: build entry points, KC builder,
 overlays, kernel patches 0050-0052

The piano additions to the k27 tree (Droid-VM/macOS-DroidVM abcbc18): build-k27-piano.sh (the
kernel), build-metal-plugin-piano.sh and scripts/piano-frontend-patch.py (the Metal plugin),
k27/kc-build27-piano.py and k27/build-native-display-piano.sh, the KC keep list, overlay edits
(DroidVMDisplay, NativeAdrenoMetalPlugin), overlay-piano/, droidvm-audio 0004, droidvm-video
0013-0017 and patches/xnu-12377 0050-0052 (VM-guest TLB, power-off, zone VA).

From the maintainer's local k27 checkout, commit a1e3f4e, without its four VM-host orchestration
scripts (boot-disk-piano.sh, iterate-k27-piano.sh, restart-vm-piano.sh and a .bak copy): they
drove the retired Gunyah VM over the local network and nothing in the native build reads them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
